    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present this generously proportioned second-floor apartment in the highly regarded Grace Park Manor development built by Cosgrave Builders. Beautifully maintained No. 212 offers a quality home in a peaceful, established setting making this property an attractive choice for first-time buyers, investors and downsizers.\n \nThe accommodation opens with a welcoming entrance hall and practical storage closet. There is a very spacious open plan living, dining and kitchen area, with balcony of the living area. Two generously sized double bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes and overlooks the landscaped communal grounds. The spacious primary bedroom includes an ensuite, while a well-appointed main bathroom completes the accommodation.\n \nGrace Park Manor is a secure gated development just off the Swords Road, set amid beautifully maintained landscaped grounds. Pedestrian and vehicular access combine with a calm, private residential environment, while an on-site caretaker supports the day to day upkeep of the development.\n \nThe convenience of this location is difficult to surpass. Griffith Avenue and Drumcondra Village are within walking distance, placing shops, cafés, restaurants, pubs, hotels and leisure facilities close at hand. The area is also well served by excellent schools and offers easy access to Dublin City University, St. Patrick's College, Beaumont Hospital, the Mater Hospital and the Bon Secours Hospital. Dublin Airport is a short drive away, while the M1, M50 and Port Tunnel provide excellent connections to the wider road network. A nearby Quality Bus Corridor offers frequent and convenient access to Dublin City Centre, making the apartment particularly well suited to commuters."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nwith wooden flooring, intercom and storage closet\n\nKitchen - 5.60m x 1.7m\nwith tiled flooring, ample storage and is plumbed for a washing machine and dish washer.\n\nLiving / Dining room - 5.64m x 3.80m\nvery spacious area with wood flooring, electric fire in the living area and access to the balcony.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.58m x 2.50m\ndouble bedroom with carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.92m x 1.66m\nrecently fitted, fully tiled with wc, whb and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.40m x 4.30m\ndouble bedroom with carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.20m x 1.63m\nwith bath and shower, wc, whb and hot-press.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious second-floor apartment</li><li>Two generous double bedrooms</li><li>Primary bedroom with ensuite</li><li>Fitted wardrobes in both bedrooms</li><li>Bright open-plan living and dining room</li><li>Balcony accessed from the living room</li><li>Secure development behind electric gates</li><li>Mature landscaped communal gardens</li><li>Ample underground car parking</li><li>Full-time caretaker on site</li><li>Management fees 3,315 approx</li><li>Excellent access to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport, the M1, M50 and Port Tunnel</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B\nBER No: 119885606\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 137.03 (kWh/m2/yr)"
      },
